{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpfall is a 2D platformer focused on mobility, precision, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: get from point A to point B, but the path is filled with obstacles that will test your skill and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-to-right movement in side-scrolling scenarios and a double jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack to reach higher areas and explore different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhat complex levels depending on the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpfall is ideal for those who enjoy classic platformers but are looking for a simple experience where you can turn off your brain for a while to pass the time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053230?t=1774847869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053230?t=1774847869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053230/eb1084e684198b53a396f8c88afec30824ff5557/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774847869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053230/eb1084e684198b53a396f8c88afec30824ff5557/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774847869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpfall is a 2D platformer focused on mobility, precision, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_pa